# Third-party solver source (Karel Horak's one-sided POSG solver) -- not ours to
# redistribute, no LICENSE file present. Only our own scripts/docs/visualizations
# and generated game/data files are tracked in this repo.
*.cpp
*.h
*.iml
CMakeLists.txt
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
Makefile
cmake_install.cmake
modules/
oracles/
StochasticGamesCpp
sources.tar
game_format.txt
profile.html
.idea/
.DS_Store

# Pre-existing example games that shipped with the solver, not generated by us
games/peg*.posg

# Separate, unrelated exploratory thread (small-LM / RL), tracked elsewhere
rl/

# Working docs/notes (interview prep, raw research journal) -- not for outside eyes.
# The visualization pages are the polished, public-facing version of this material.
docs/

# Intermediate data files consumed by the generator/build scripts and baked into the
# visualization pages at build time -- not needed at runtime, not included.
games/*.json
games/*.jsonl
